notes: 'Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:2375); no CAS-RN or
  CHEBI/NCIT match. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as an animal-derived bile preparation pending
  source-backed composition curation. Issue1201 successor scope: The source ingredient
  is desiccated ox bile, a dried bovine bile material. NBRC1004 and NBRC1390 independently
  name desiccated ox bile as a weighed dry ingredient; Sigma70168 confirms the material
  is produced by dehydrating fresh ox bile. This is neither fresh liquid bile nor
  an isolated bile salt, and no supplier-specific grade or constituent concentration
  is asserted. Generic ox-bile owners and Oxgall are recorded reconciliation candidates,
  not automatically merged or equated to this explicitly dried material.'
